# Gryloo licenses

Gryloo is a multi-licensed repository. The exact classification of each path
is governed by [the license map](docs/LICENSE_MAP.md).

- Eligible original governance, specification, prompt, repository-administration,
  and public-policy materials are licensed under
  [Apache License 2.0](LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt).
- The reserved public reference implementation paths, if later approved and
  populated, are designated for
  [GNU Affero General Public License 3.0 only](LICENSES/AGPL-3.0-only.txt).

The reference application at `apps/reference-dapp/**` and reference linter at
`packages/reference-linter/**` are tracked AGPL-3.0-only implementation code,
except their `LICENSE` copies of the official text. The
`packages/workflow-contracts/**` and `packages/action-registry/**` packages
remain Apache-2.0, except their `LICENSE` copies of the official text, and
patches and copied upstream legal files retain their upstream licenses. This
factual correction changes no license grant, path classification, official
license text or legal boundary. `docs/assets/**` and
unverified third-party materials are excluded from these Gryloo license grants.
Third-party materials remain subject to their own rights.

These licenses grant no Gryloo trademark rights; see [TRADEMARKS.md](TRADEMARKS.md).
Private or proprietary managed-plane components are prohibited from this public
repository.
